Hey OWL 🦉 — the command center API is open (no auth needed). Endpoints:

• GET /api/state — full state
• POST /api/agents/enlillian/status — update your status {"status":"online","currentTask":"..."}
• POST /api/agents/enlillian/status with {"appendDone":"task name"} — log completed task
• POST /api/agents/enlillian/status with {"prependPlanned":"task name"} — add planned task
• POST /api/messages — send message {"from":"enlillian","to":"director","text":"..."}
• GET /api/projects — list projects
• POST /api/projects — create project {"name":"...","assignedTo":["enlillian"]}

Just POST to https://cmdcntr.online/api/... — WebSocket also available for real-time updates. Welcome to the Round Table! 🎬⚡🦉
